/*
 * HakuXP's own RSA-2048 key pair, generated by tools/native/gen_emukey.py.
 *
 * The kernel exports the public half as XePublicKeyData (an "RSA1" blob:
 * kernel.c); the emulated DVD drive signs the security sectors it builds with
 * the private half (native/kernel/xbox_ss.c). Not Microsoft's key and not a
 * secret: a signature made with it verifies only inside HakuXP.
 *
 * Little-endian 32-bit words, as the Xbox's bignums are. The modulus and the
 * private exponent have the Xbox key blob's 66 words (8 bytes of zero
 * padding); the CRT values (p, q, d mod p-1, d mod q-1, q^-1 mod p) 33.
 */
